# the standing recipe serves with --batch 6, so every decode window is a batch window
# (batch_rec_ true) and STRATA_BATCH_G2 is unset, so G=1: the shared expert already runs once
# per layer over all rows.  The armed boots printed only 'declined (G != 2 or T outside 2..8)'
# - 37 of 37 captures.
#
# NOT DEAD CODE IN GENERAL: for non-batch windows split_ (Verifier::set_split, default on)
# still yields G=2, so this arms on the serial/coalesced and pipeline-windows lanes.  Shelf it
# for those lanes.
#
# The change is bitwise-per-row by construction (env-gated, default off, unset = byte-identical);
# with it applied, shared_expert_parity / mmvq_multi_parity / verify_parity all passed, and
# src/core/verify.cpp compiled with no new warnings (the one raise_flag warning predates it).
# Apply with: git apply campaign/shelf/shared-hoist-F362.patch  (rollback: git checkout -- src/core/verify.cpp)
# Arm with: STRATA_SHARED_HOIST=1 (decline cases print one line per captured window).
#
